sequenceDiagram
    actor Seller as 卖家
    actor Buyer as 买家
    participant API as Order/LogisticsController
    participant OS as OrderServiceImpl
    participant LS as LogisticsServiceImpl
    participant DB as 订单与物流表
    Seller->>API: 提交发货
    API->>OS: 校验卖家归属和待发货状态
    OS->>DB: 更新已发货状态
    OS->>LS: 创建物流轨迹
    LS->>DB: 写入首个物流节点
    API-->>Seller: 发货成功
    Buyer->>API: 查询物流
    API->>LS: 按订单归属查询轨迹
    LS-->>Buyer: 返回节点
    Buyer->>API: 确认收货
    API->>OS: 校验买家归属
    OS->>DB: 更新待评价状态
    API-->>Buyer: 收货成功
